\* All TLC check configs for AntflyDocumentIdentityRangeRepair.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyDocumentIdentityRangeRepair.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = FALSE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    SplitRequiresHealthySource
    SplitDestinationStatusMatchesExpectedNamespace
    MergeRequiresCompatibleIdentityStatus
    MergeReassignmentRequiresOptInAndHealthyStatus
    StrictRestoreRejectsNamespaceMismatch
    RuntimeRepairRequiresRecoveredPrimaryImport
    RestoreIntentClearsOnlyAfterRepairComplete
    Safety

==== BadMergeActiveReassign
\* Expected-failure config: merge namespace reassignment runs without the
\* required opt-in and healthy donor/receiver identity status.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = FALSE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = TRUE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    MergeReassignmentRequiresOptInAndHealthyStatus

==== BadMergeMismatch
