==== BadRestoreEarlyClear
\* Expected-failure config: metadata clears restore intent before primary
\* import recovery and runtime repair have both completed.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = FALSE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    RestoreIntentClearsOnlyAfterRepairComplete

==== BadRestoreNamespace
\* Expected-failure config: strict deferred restore accepts a source snapshot
\* whose document identity namespace does not match the target namespace.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = FALSE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = TRUE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    StrictRestoreRejectsNamespaceMismatch

==== BadSplitDestNamespace
\* Expected-failure config: split destination status accepts a stale document
\* identity namespace instead of the expected destination namespace.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = FALSE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = TRUE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    SplitDestinationStatusMatchesExpectedNamespace

==== BadSplitUnhealthy
\* Expected-failure config: split validation accepts a source group whose
\* document identity lifecycle is active, conflicted, rebuild-required, or
\* ordinal-exhausted.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySplitAllowsUnhealthySource = TRUE
    BuggySplitAcceptsStaleDestNamespace = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsMismatchWithoutOptIn = FALSE
    BuggyMergeAllowsActiveReassignment = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreAcceptsNamespaceMismatch = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreClearsBeforeRepair = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    SplitRequiresHealthySource
